        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "# Lionel Multi-Clip Roundup Study 05\n\n## Curated Media Mosaic\n\nA roughly **1:16:11** episode moving through a queue of religious, political, cultural, and interpersonal media exhibits.\n\n**1 opening alarm**  \n**1 sponsor break**  \n**at least 7 distinct media objects**  \n**multiple live pivots**  \n**an unfinished close promising continuation**\n\n`ALARM -> SPONSOR -> FRAME THEME -> PLAY CLIP -> INTERRUPT -> INTERPRET -> JUMP SOURCES -> FIND PATTERN -> PROMISE CONTINUATION`\n\nThe queue is the spine. The theme is the glue.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
