        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-multi-clip-roundup-study-05"
        },
        "markdown": "# 📺 Source and Attribution Boundary\n\n**Duration represented:** approximately 1:16:11.\n\nLionel announces a fact-packed mosaic involving Candace Owens, Tyler Robinson, Charlie Kirk, religion, politics, and statements he believes could encourage harm toward Candace. \n\nThe transcript contains no reliable speaker labels. Playback boundaries are inferred from commands such as `listen`, `watch this`, `let me stop`, and `jump to this one`.\n\nThe episode contains allegations, insults, legal interpretations, political opinions, and descriptions of disputed events. This graph records their rhetorical and production functions. It does not convert them into verified facts.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
