        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-multi-clip-roundup-study-05"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧭 Central Observation\n\nStudy 05 confirms the previously hypothetical **multi-topic roundup**, but the more precise label is `Curated Media Mosaic`.\n\nLionel does not develop one proposition as cleanly as Study 01, follow one source timeline as in Study 03, or audit one opponent as in Study 04. He moves through a prepared or semi-prepared queue of clips that illustrate a broad emotional and ideological claim: public discourse has become incoherent, performative, threatening, hypocritical, and increasingly detached from evidence.\n\nThe episode advances by **selection and juxtaposition**. Each clip becomes another tile in the mosaic.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
