        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-multi-clip-roundup-study-05"
        },
        "markdown": "# 1 · Alarm Hook and Sponsor\n## 0:00–2:30\n\nLionel opens at maximum intensity, promising a dense collection of issues and alleging that religious language is being used in a way that could endanger Candace Owens. He then immediately inserts the recurring Noble Gold sponsor message. \n\n**Function:** establish urgency, promise abundance rather than one argument, monetize after the hook, and return to the editorial body.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
