        "markdown": "# 5 · Internet Feud Exhibit\n## 30:05–35:29\n\nThe episode pivots into an online dispute between two personalities. Lionel supplies context, plays an angry profanity-filled clip, interrupts to disclaim the language, and treats the exchange as evidence that people surrounding the controversy are losing emotional control. \n\nHe contrasts the outburst with Candace Owens's comparatively controlled public demeanor.\n\n**Function:** use behavior and affect, rather than a factual claim, as an exhibit in a broader character comparison.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
