        "markdown": "# 7 · Ideological Gobbledygook Exhibit\n## 44:44–49:20\n\nLionel introduces a Liz Wheeler and Glenn Beck clip and challenges the audience to determine what the speakers mean. As the passage moves among Trump, a new world order, AI factories, energy, and the Middle East, Lionel repeatedly questions the coherence of the claims and jokingly proposes a show called `What Are They Talking About?` \n\n**Function:** make incomprehensibility itself the object of commentary.\n\nThis is not a factual rebuttal so much as a **coherence audit**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
