        "markdown": "# 9 · Israel Red-Line Exhibit\n## 59:56–1:12:10\n\nLionel provides extended biographies and evaluations of John Fetterman and Jon Stewart before finally playing their exchange. The clip asks whether agreement on Israel is being treated as a condition for belonging in the Democratic Party. \n\nLionel pauses to endorse Stewart's distinction between Israel and the Jewish community, identifies subject changes in Fetterman's answers, and treats the exchange as evidence of a larger political realignment. \n\n**Function:** use one clip to crystallize a theme that has appeared throughout the queue.",
