        "markdown": "# 10 · Movement Synthesis and Interrupted Close\n## 1:12:10–1:16:11\n\nLionel says that everything is changing and describes Candace Owens as drawing together a newly attentive audience around faith, family, political independence, and questions about Charlie Kirk. \n\nThe episode ends because Lionel's wife has another interview. He tells the audience he is not finished, proposes continuing later, promotes her account, asks for subscriptions and notifications, and closes the current stream as one installment rather than a completed argument. \n\n**Function:** synthesize the mosaic into a movement narrative, then create a bridge to a future broadcast.",
