        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-multi-clip-roundup-study-05"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🎞️ New Discovery · Source Queue\n\nStudy 05 requires a structure above individual commentary beats:\n\n## Media Queue\nAn ordered but editable collection of source items that Lionel may:\n\n- preview\n- skip\n- jump to early\n- postpone\n- play partially\n- abandon\n- return to later\n- connect to another source by analogy\n\nThe transcript repeatedly contains queue-management language:\n\n- `put that over there`\n- `we will get to that`\n- `did you see this one`\n- `hang on`\n- `jump to this one`\n- `we will talk about this later`\n\nA roundup graph therefore needs both **episode order** and **editorial queue state**. Those are not always identical.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
