        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-multi-clip-roundup-study-05"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🔴 Live Production and Serial Continuation\n\nStudy 05 exposes the live nature of the format more clearly than earlier specimens.\n\nLionel:\n\n- responds to chat comments\n- searches for or chooses clips during the stream\n- says he has not heard one clip before\n- changes the order of planned material\n- abandons or truncates subjects\n- reacts to an external household schedule\n- promises to resume later from the stopping point\n\nThe episode therefore needs a `continuationState` containing:\n\n- completed queue items\n- partially covered items\n- deferred items\n- current thematic thread\n- intended next source\n- follow-up stream reference\n\nThe close is a **pause in a serial analysis**, not a fully resolved conclusion.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
