          "graphId": "lionel-multi-clip-roundup-study-05"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧪 Provisional Node Types\n\n## Strong new candidates\n1. **Lionel Curates a Media Queue**\n2. **Lionel Introduces the Next Exhibit**\n3. **Lionel Primes an Interpretation**\n4. **Lionel Audits Coherence**\n5. **Lionel Contrasts Personas**\n6. **Lionel Extracts a Cross-Clip Pattern**\n7. **Lionel Defers a Topic**\n8. **Lionel Promises Continuation**\n\n## Shared media and production candidates\n9. **Media Queue**\n10. **Queue Item**\n11. **Deferred Source**\n12. **Clip-to-Clip Bridge**\n13. **Continuation State**\n14. **Sponsor Break**\n15. **Live Chat Interjection**\n\n## Possible consolidation\n`Introduces Next Exhibit`, `Primes Interpretation`, and `Defers Topic` may be roles attached to a queue item rather than permanent classes.",
