      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-multi-clip-roundup-study-05"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🔬 Comparison Across Five Studies\n\n## Study 01 · Thesis Monologue\n**Spine:** one central proposition.\n\n## Study 02 · Hosted Forensic Commentary\n**Spine:** evidence anomalies inside another host's container.\n\n## Study 03 · Annotated Media Reaction\n**Spine:** one external source timeline.\n\n## Study 04 · Thesis-Led Adversarial Media Audit\n**Spine:** Lionel's evaluation of one opponent's argument, with clips used as exhibits.\n\n## Study 05 · Curated Media Mosaic\n**Spine:** a queue of multiple source objects connected by theme, analogy, escalation, and persona comparison.\n\n## Critical lesson\nA media-heavy episode can still have several distinct grammars:\n\n- source-led\n- thesis-led\n- opponent-led\n- queue-led\n\nThe number of clips does not identify the format. **What controls sequence identifies the format.**",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
