      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-multi-clip-roundup-study-05"
        },
        "markdown": "# ⚖️ Required Attribution Model\n\nThe rapid source switching makes provenance more important than ever.\n\nEach statement should be distinguishable as:\n\n- source clip speech\n- Lionel quotation or paraphrase\n- Lionel factual assertion\n- Lionel legal interpretation\n- Lionel psychological or character inference\n- Lionel speculation about motive\n- live chat contribution\n- transcript uncertainty\n- our structural observation\n\nEach queue item should retain:\n\n- original source identity\n- local playback range\n- original speaker\n- clip title or description\n- reason selected\n- commentary nodes attached\n- status: planned, played, skipped, deferred, or abandoned\n\nWithout that structure, the mosaic collapses into one unattributed voice.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
