      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-multi-clip-roundup-study-05"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🏗️ Updated Lionel Package Model\n\n## Shared primitives\nVideo Source, Timed Segment, Transcript Segment, Embedded Source, Claim, Evidence Item, Hypothesis, Person, Organization, Playback Transition.\n\n## New queue primitives\nMedia Queue, Queue Item, Queue Status, Clip Bridge, Deferred Topic, Continuation State.\n\n## Stable Lionel moves\nStates Thesis, Adds Analogy, Audits Evidence, Defines Standard, Builds Rapport, Separates Questions, Qualifies Theory, Directs Audience.\n\n## Media moves\nFrames Media, Comments on Media, Replays Media, Summarizes Media, Audits Argument, Corrects Formulation, Audits Coherence, Contrasts Personas, Extracts Cross-Clip Pattern.\n\n## Composition templates now observed\n- Lionel Thesis Monologue\n- Hosted Forensic Commentary\n- Annotated Media Reaction\n- Thesis-Led Adversarial Media Audit\n- Curated Media Mosaic",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786057401824,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
